  m_text: 'This is a Demonstration Note!


    Notes support the Location system


    They
    can be used for:

    - Telling a Story

    - Presenting instructions in a Game

    -
    Hints to e.g. Safes, Codes

    - Many Others


    They support Rich Text:

    <color=red>-
    Colors</color>.

    <b>-Bold Text</b>.

    <u>- Underline</u>.

    <i>- Tilt</i>.

    <size=18>-
    Text size</size>.

    - And other features'
